WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.305
The shadow arrives.

00:02.111 --> 00:07.445
This is the Moon's shadow crossing the Earth, drawn from where the Sun and the Moon really are.

00:08.018 --> 00:14.886
Under the pale outer part people see a bite taken out of the Sun; only under the small dark core is it covered completely.
